7. VOTE AGAINST THE PROPAGANDA MACHINE. The 
Unabomber did an end run around the media monopoly, 
and published without editorial clearance. The 
Unabomber has, by the magnitude of his plan, 
exposed the media as a closed communications 
system, making it very clear--in case anyone hadn`t 
